Falsifies `calendar::verification::a_day_number_always_decodes_to_a_real_date`.

The defect: `civil_from_days` computes the day of the month one too high (`+ 2` for `+ 1`). The last day of a
month decodes to a day that month does not have.

Expected to fail: the harness's `assert!(1 <= d && d <= days_in_month(y, m).unwrap())`.

